  "slug": "do-you-know-them",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/16943_do-you-know-them.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Do you know these two people? She is my Chinese teacher, surnamed Wang; he is my brother's English teacher, surnamed Li. Teacher Wang is very beautiful. She is twenty-eight years old and likes traveling and running. Teacher Li is very tall, thirty-two years old, and works in a university. The two have known each other for five years and have a daughter and a son. The daughter is one year old and the son is three years old. They can speak Chinese and English. Teacher Wang and Teacher Li are both very good people. My brother and I like them very much."
  ],
  "english_full": "Do you know these two people? She is my Chinese teacher, surnamed Wang; he is my brother's English teacher, surnamed Li. Teacher Wang is very beautiful. She is twenty-eight years old and likes traveling and running. Teacher Li is very tall, thirty-two years old, and works in a university. The two have known each other for five years and have a daughter and a son. The daughter is one year old and the son is three years old. They can speak Chinese and English. Teacher Wang and Teacher Li are both very good people. My brother and I like them very much.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Вы зна́ете э́ти два́ человека? Она́ — моя́ кита́йская наста́вница с фами́лией Ва́нг; он — наста́вник моего́ бра́та с фами́лией Ли. На́ставница Ва́нг о́чень краси́вая. Ей два́дцать во́семь лет, и она́ лю́бит пое́зды, а такжé бе́г. На́ставник Ли о́чень высо́кий, ему́ три́дцать два́ года, и он рабо́тает в университе́те. Эти два́ человека зна́ют друг дру́га пять лет и имеют до́чку и сы́на. До́чке о́дин год, а сы́ну три года. Они́ говори́т на кита́йском и англи́йском языках. На́ставница Ва́нг и на́ставник Ли оба́ о́чень хоро́шие лю́ди. Мы́ с бра́том о́чень их лю́бим."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Vy znáete éti dvá chelovéka? Oná — moyá kitáyskaya nastávnitsa s famíliyei Váng; on — nastávnik moegó bratá s famíliyei Li. Nastávnitsa Váng óchen' krasiváya. Eĭ dvá­dtsat' vósem' let, i oná lyúbit poezdý, a takzhe bég. Nastávnik Li óchen' vysokií, emú trí́dtsat' dvá goda, i on rabotáet v universiteté. Eti dvá chelovéka znáyut drug drugá pyat' let i iméyut dôchku i sýna. Dôchke odín god, a sýnu tri goda. Oný govorít na kitáyskom i anglíyskom yazykakh. Nastávnitsa Váng i nastávnik Li obá óchen' khoroshíye lyudí. My s bratóm óchen' ikh lyúbit."
  ],
